# run command ... on remote ... using credential (D84). otterPS asks
# PowerShell remoting only once it has the credential; these never get that
# far: a name that cannot be a credential, then one that is not stored.
try
    run command "hostname" on remote "localhost" using credential "bad/name" into r
    say "wrong" r
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
say "next"
run command "hostname" on remote "localhost" using credential "p2-no-such-credential"
say "not reached"
